    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro ebirukukwata ha ndwara z'orususu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Musa na Arooni ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu obu araabaga n'akantu akanyakuzimbire ha rususu orw'omubiri gwe, rundi naayatika omubiri, rundi anyina ibara likarugwamu endwara ey'ebigenge ha rususu rw'omubiri gwe, nubwo araaleetwaga hali Arooni nyakatagara rundi hali omu ha batabani ba nyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nyakatagara ayekebiije ekiikaro ekinyakurwaire ha rususu rw'omubiri, kakuba akooya k'omubiri akanyakuli ha kacweka akanyakurwaire kaba kahindukire nikeera, ekihooya kikazooka kyerimire omu rususu rw'omubiri gwe, buli egi ndwara y'ebigenge; kakuba nyakatagara amwetegereza, amurangege nkooku arukuzirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu kakuba akacweka akanyakurwaire ha rususu rw'omubiri gwe kaba nikeera kandi nikazooka kateerimire kiina n'akooya akanyakurumu katahindukire kakeera, nyakatagara alindege omuntu ogu anyakurwaire, amulindege ali wenka okumara ebiro musanju, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo amwekebiije ha kiro ekya musanju, kakuba arora endwara tehindukire kandi tekanyire ha mubiri, ayongere amulinde wenka ebiro musanju ebindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayongere amurole ha kiro kya musanju, kandi ekicweka ekirwaire kakuba kiba nikiiragura, kandi endwara teyeyongiire ha rususu rw'omubiri, nubwo amurange nkooku atarukuzirwa, ndwara y'okwatika omubiri kwonka, omurwaire ayogye ebyokujwara bye nukwo aleke kuzirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu kakuba obuhooya bugenda nibukanya ha rususu rw'omubiri, omurwaire amazire kweyoleka nyakatagara habw'okusemezibwa kwe, agaruke ayeyoleke nyakatagara; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyakatagara amwekebiije, ekihooya kakuba kiba kigenzire nikirya orususu, amurange nkooku arukuzirwa, buli eki kigenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu obu akwatwa bwango ebigenge, bamuleetere nyakatagara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyakatagara amwekebiije; kakuba hazooka akazimba akarukwera ha rususu rw'omubiri, kahindwire akooya kaayera, kandi akazimba ako karumu amasira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buli ebi bigenge ebitarukukira omu rususu rw'omubiri gwe, nyakatagara amurangirre nkooku arukuzirwa, amwikazeege wenka, habwokuba naazirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuba ebigenge bituruka, hanyuma bikamara omubiri gwona ogw'omuntu anyakurwaire okuruga ha mutwe okuhika ha bigere nkooku nyakatagara araabaga arozire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayekebiijege, kakuba ebigenge biba biijwire omubiri gw'omuntu ogu, nyakatagara amurangirrege nkooku arukuzirwa, habwokuba orususu rwona ruhindukire rwayera, obu aliba atakyazirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu azookwaho ekizimba ekinyakurumu amasira, obu afooka arukuzirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara ayekebiije ekizimba eki ekinyakurumu amasira, amurangirre nkooku arukuzirwa, ekizimba eki ekirumu amasira kimuleetera kuzirwa, habwokuba nibyo bigenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekizimba eki, kakuba kirugwamu ekihooya eky'erangi erukwera, omurwaire aije hali nyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara amwekebiije, ebizimba obu biraaba birugirwemu ebihooya ebyerangi erukwera, nubwo nyakatagara arangirre omuntu anyakurwaire nkooku atarukuzirwa, habwokuba tanyina kantu ha mubiri gwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu rususu rw'omubiri gw'omuntu obu habamu ekizimba ekinyakukizire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu kiikaro ky'ekiturugunyu hakazimbamu ekintu ekirukwera rundi akahere akarukutukulikana, ako koolekwe nyakatagara ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo nyakatagara akeekebiije, kakuba arora keerimire kataahire omunda y'orususu, kandi akooya akanyakurumu kahindukire nikeera, aho nyakatagara amurangirre nkooku arukuzirwa, endwara ei ainayo y'ebigenge, endwara egi erugire omu kizimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nyakatagara kakuba agyekebiija akasanga akooya akanyakumeziremu katarukwera, ekihooya kiteerimire omu rususu rw'omubiri, kandi nikyeerrukana, nyakatagara amulindege ali wenka kumara ebiro musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuba ekihooya kigenda nikirya orususu rw'omubiri, aho amurangirre nkooku arukuzirwa, oburwaire nibukyatandika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekihooya kakuba kiikara nkooku kiri, kitaliire rususu egi neeba eri nkojo y'ekizimba, nyakatagara amurangirre nkooku atarukuzirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rundi orususu rw'omubiri obu ruraaba ruhiire, enyama empyaka enyakumezire omu kicweka ekihyereriire akazimba akakutukuramu rundi akeera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyakatagara agyekebiije, kakuba akooya akanyakumezire omu kihooya kaba kahindukire nikeera kandi kyerimire enyanga, obu ebi bigenge birugire ha kuhyererra, nyakatagara amurangirre nkooku arukuzirwa, egi ndwara y'ebigenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nyakatagara kakuba arora ekihooya, akooya akanyakuli omukihooya katarukwera kandi ekihooya kiteerimire nyanga omu rususu, baitu nikinanata, amulindege ali wenka kumara ebiro musanju, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amwekebiije ha kiro ekya musanju kakuba ekihooya kiba nikyeyongera kugaliha ha rususu, nabwo nyakatagara amurangirre nkooku arukuzirwa, egi ndwara y'ebigenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekihooya kakuba kiba kiikaire nkooku kyali, kitarukweyongera kugaliha ha rususu rw'omubiri kandi nikinanata, okuzimba kukaruga omu kuhyererra, nyakatagara amurangege nkooku atarukuzirwa, habwokuba oru ruhyora orwalesirwe okuhyererra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
